  "_source": "The headings each employer prints, verbatim, from the layouts of SASBO's fifteen samples (fixtures' LAYOUTS.md and layouts.json, 6-7 Oct 2026, read by shape only). A heading is compared upper-cased with every run of punctuation and spaces made one space; 're:' marks a regular expression over that key, for headings that carry a month or a code. 'typed' reads the rows an administrator typed; 'general' finds every field by the vocabulary alone, for an employer with no sample yet.",
